  "title": "Refined Cooking",
  "description": "A mod that allows Refined Storage and Cooking for Blockheads to work together!",
  "body": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Part of a family bridging storage and cooking mods-see the full list below-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Part of a mod family\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Header.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Header\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for-NeoForge | Fabric | Forge-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft Versions Badge\" width=\"341\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client &amp; Server-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Install Badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://meloncube.net/sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"width: 100%;\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Promo.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Promo\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%;\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Description.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Description\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This is a mod that allows Refined Storage and Cooking for Blockheads to work together!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Two new blocks (Kitchen Station and Kitchen Access Point) and one item (Kitchen Network Card) added.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The Kitchen Station needs to be placed as part of the kitchen network and the Kitchen Access Point needs to be placed in the Refined Storage Network.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The Kitchen Station acts as Refined Storage Network Receiver and needs to be attached to a Kitchen Network Card. Then this Kitchen Network Card needs to be placed inside a Kitchen Access Point, which acts as a Refined Storage Network Transmitter.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Once everything is connected, you'll be able to consume items from your Refined Storage network right from your cooking table.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Water and milk are pulled straight from fluid storage as well.</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%;\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Recipes.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking Recipes\"></p>\n<h2>Blocks</h2>\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>&nbsp;</th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Connected</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Linked but Offline</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Unlinked</strong></span></th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Kitchen Station&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fz78JtrT/rc-kitchen-station.png\" alt=\"rc kitchen station\" border=\"0\"></td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rqk5MJR/rc-kitchen-station-linked-offline.png\" alt=\"rc kitchen station linked offline\" border=\"0\"></td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/35LVRrk6/rc-kitchen-station-unlinked.png\" alt=\"rc kitchen station unlinked\" border=\"0\"></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Kitchen Access Point&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bh0fKKs/rc-kitchen-access-point.png\" alt=\"rc kitchen access point\" border=\"0\"></td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hJ0YrCJH/rc-access-point-offline-card.png\" alt=\"rc access point offline card\" border=\"0\"></td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1GxrpQ87/rc-access-point-offline.png\" alt=\"rc access point offline\" border=\"0\"></td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Integrations</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The mod runs fine on its own. The optional mods below are supported depending on the Minecraft version. The in-game guide is a Patchouli book, so Patchouli needs to be installed to read it.</span></p>\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Minecraft</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Loader</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>JEI</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>REI</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>EMI</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Jade</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>The One Probe</strong></span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Patchouli</strong></span></th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.18.x, 1.19.x, 1.20.1</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.20.4</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">NeoForge</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">1.21.1</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">NeoForge, Fabric</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes (NeoForge)</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">26.1.2</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">NeoForge, Fabric</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No</span></td>\n            <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Yes</span></td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">On 1.21.1, The One Probe works on NeoForge only, since it has no Fabric build. Jade covers the same in-world info on Fabric.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jk7KQnmh/RC.png\" alt=\"RC\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<h2>More from this series</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Every mod below bridges one storage system to one cooking mod. Same idea, different pairing, pick the one that fits your pack.</span></p>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th style=\"background-color: #7f1620; color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center; background-color: #7f1620; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Cooking for Blockheads</span></th>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center; background-color: #7f1620; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Farmer's Delight</span></th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center; background-color: #7f1620; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Applied Energistics 2</span></th>\n            <td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Applied Cooking</span></a></td>\n            <td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/applied-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Applied Delight</span></a></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center; background-color: #7f1620; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Refined Storage</span></th>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #e78a4e; color: #1f1f1f;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #1f1f1f;\"><strong>Refined Cooking</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #1f1f1f;\">you're viewing this</span></td>\n            <td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/refined-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Refined Delight</span></a></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <th style=\"text-align: center; background-color: #7f1620; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Occultism</span></th>\n            <td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/occult-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Occult Cooking</span></a></td>\n            <td><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #999999;\">Occult Delight<br><em>(coming soon)</em></span></td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Socials</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Sebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Modrinth\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://x.com/ItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@ItsSebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Twitter\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Sebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Youtube\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=ItsSebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitch&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Twitch\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Sebastrn&amp;color=e78a4e&amp;labelColor=7f1620&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn's Github\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n",
